WEBVTT

00:20.183 --> 00:24.666
They try

00:26.247 --> 00:29.729
to

00:29.769 --> 00:31.010
break

00:40.996 --> 00:41.616
the circle

00:44.695 --> 00:49.958
They try to tear the seam But you can't put a price

00:49.998 --> 00:52.839
tag on the architects of a dream

00:55.721 --> 01:00.123
We stood out in the freezing rain Our backs

01:00.283 --> 01:05.686
against the wall But looking at the five of us, I

01:05.726 --> 01:07.708
knew we'd never fall

01:10.547 --> 01:14.909
The compass always points me back to you The only

01:17.931 --> 01:25.094
thing I've ever known is true

01:25.775 --> 01:30.197
We built a fortress out of the fire We took the

01:30.257 --> 01:33.799
engine and we pushed it higher Through the

01:33.819 --> 01:37.501
static and the heavy weather We proved that

01:37.561 --> 01:42.013
family always sticks together Oh, we're

01:42.093 --> 01:47.017
standing in the light Yeah, we won the fight

01:47.057 --> 01:49.559
tonight

01:51.180 --> 01:54.122
We didn't need the spotlight, didn't need the

01:54.182 --> 01:57.624
gold We kept the only promises that never could

01:57.664 --> 02:00.566
be sold From the dorm rooms in the valley to the

02:00.646 --> 02:02.768
neon city streets

02:05.948 --> 02:11.689
The rhythm of this family Is the only heart that

02:12.049 --> 02:15.910
beats The compass always points me back to you

02:15.930 --> 02:21.812
The only thing I've ever known is true We built a

02:21.872 --> 02:26.433
fortress out of the fire We took the engine and we

02:26.493 --> 02:30.114
pushed it higher Through the static and the

02:30.174 --> 02:33.815
heavy weather We proved that family always

02:33.835 --> 02:39.620
sticks together Oh, we're standing in the light

02:39.740 --> 02:46.809
Yeah, we won the fight tonight

03:05.434 --> 03:06.114
Hmm.

03:32.012 --> 03:39.375
No more shadows No more running blind We're

03:39.395 --> 03:45.338
leaving all the empty noise

03:45.418 --> 03:45.698
behind

03:53.470 --> 03:57.812
We built a fortress out of the fire. We took the

03:57.892 --> 04:01.453
engine and we pushed it higher. Through the

04:01.493 --> 04:05.174
static and the heavy weather, we proved that

04:05.254 --> 04:09.735
family always sticks together. Oh, we're

04:09.795 --> 04:14.676
standing in the light. Yeah, we won the fight

04:14.716 --> 04:19.758
tonight. Standing in the light.

04:24.598 --> 04:26.620
Family sticks together!

